WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.850
Lily closes after the wind-Spire knockdown.

2
00:00:00.850 --> 00:00:01.350
The backward movement leaves Ryu’s recorded throw out of range.

3
00:00:01.350 --> 00:00:02.350
Standing heavy punch punishes the throw recovery.

4
00:00:02.350 --> 00:00:03.000
Forward heavy punch continues the punish.

5
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:03.950
Heavy Condor Wind completes the punish and gains a Wind stock.

6
00:00:03.950 --> 00:00:05.550
Ryu falls from the heavy Wind finish.
